      {
        "role": "MERCHANT_INTRO_TITLE",
        "text": "[Private Rooms Available] Enjoy premium Japanese Wagyu grilled over charcoal. Now accepting reservations for year-end parties! All seats allow electronic cigarette smoking.",
        "raw": "<h3 class=\"pr-comment-title js-pr-title\">\n                [Private Rooms Available] Enjoy premium Japanese Wagyu grilled over charcoal. Now accepting reservations for year-end parties! All seats allow electronic cigarette smoking.\n              </h3>",
        "sha256": "6b0fea1b98bfcdeb562b919866431180d574b1b7854d1dadcea6c969bd93585d",
        "htmlCharacterOffset": 45120
      },
      {
        "role": "COURSE_TITLE",
        "text": "Standard Course (A5 Wagyu, 9 Dishes)",
        "raw": "<span class=\"rstdtl-course-list__course-title-text\">Standard Course (A5 Wagyu, 9 Dishes)</span>",
        "sha256": "9ef0b8a4eaba4a1969484b6fa1cd97827fbe7b1c99535c15b1a9e85ca6a6db89",
        "htmlCharacterOffset": 51541
      },
      {
        "role": "COURSE_DESCRIPTION",
        "text": "Same-day reservations accepted! The Standard Course (9 dishes, featuring A5 Wagyu). Starting with a kimchi assortment, enjoy premium salted tongue, Wagyu karubi, Wagyu loin, outside skirt, chijimi (Korean savory pancake), and more — all at a great price. You can also add a 120-minute all-you-can-drink option for an additional JPY 2,750 per person (last order at 90 minutes). Ideal for dinner gatherings, company banquets, or get-togethers with friends.",
        "raw": "<p class=\"rstdtl-course-list__desc\">\n                          Same-day reservations accepted! The Standard Course (9 dishes, featuring A5 Wagyu). Starting with a kimchi assortment, enjoy premium salted tongue, Wagyu karubi, Wagyu loin, outside skirt, chijimi (Korean savory pancake), and more — all at a great price.\n                          You can also add a 120-minute all-you-can-drink option for an additional JPY 2,750 per person (last order at 90 minutes). Ideal for dinner gatherings, company banquets, or get-togethers with friends.\n                        </p>",
        "sha256": "9ab1319d6c1b20b950f275e3051d62dc39f8aa2fd07c76ca74c81edf93f9796e",
        "htmlCharacterOffset": 51767
      },
      {
        "role": "COURSE_TITLE",
        "text": "Yansando Signature Course (A5 Wagyu, 12 Dishes)",
        "raw": "<span class=\"rstdtl-course-list__course-title-text\">Yansando Signature Course (A5 Wagyu, 12 Dishes)</span>",
        "sha256": "5d8e2b093569968df9a3dbab590287d7bb9b2c8c77619971dc30eede332caa57",
        "htmlCharacterOffset": 54944
      },
      {
        "role": "COURSE_DESCRIPTION",
        "text": "Same-day reservations accepted! The Yansando Signature Course — 12 dishes including A5 Wagyu. Starting with an assorted namul platter, enjoy Yakiniku Yansando’s popular dishes to the fullest, including premium salted beef tongue, chijimi (Korean-style pancake), toro karubi (rich marbled short rib), Chuck Eye Roll, jar‑marinated yakiniku, and today’s rice dish. You can also add a 120-minute all-you-can-drink option for an additional JPY 2,750 per person (last order at 90 minutes). This is our top recommended plan—ideal for first-time guests and various banquets; if you are undecided, choose this course.",
        "raw": "<p class=\"rstdtl-course-list__desc\">\n                          Same-day reservations accepted! The Yansando Signature Course — 12 dishes including A5 Wagyu. Starting with an assorted namul platter, enjoy Yakiniku Yansando’s popular dishes to the fullest, including premium salted beef tongue, chijimi (Korean-style pancake), toro karubi (rich marbled short rib), Chuck Eye Roll, jar‑marinated yakiniku, and today’s rice dish.\n                          You can also add a 120-minute all-you-can-drink option for an additional JPY 2,750 per person (last order at 90 minutes). This is our top recommended plan—ideal for first-time guests and various banquets; if you are undecided, choose this course.\n                        </p>",
        "sha256": "d951a85486f8133299d3077d67f2a5382adf9f5cfd8360610050062bdec94d18",
        "htmlCharacterOffset": 55182
      },
      {
        "role": "COURSE_TITLE",
        "text": "Rare Cuts Tasting Course (A5 Wagyu, 12 Dishes)",
        "raw": "<span class=\"rstdtl-course-list__course-title-text\">Rare Cuts Tasting Course (A5 Wagyu, 12 Dishes)</span>",
        "sha256": "1f7e0e9deed11a312d4201180abe5e8202f9b51c58b92d74daba8bcf2cfad694",
        "htmlCharacterOffset": 58525
      },
      {
        "role": "COURSE_DESCRIPTION",
        "text": "The \"Rare Cuts Tasting Course\" — 12 dishes including A5 Wagyu. Starting with an assorted kimchi, the course features seared Wagyu sushi, Premium salted tongue, salted strip loin, salted top blade, hanging tender, and today's finishing dish, allowing you to enjoy both popular items and rare cuts. You can also add a 120-minute all-you-can-drink option for an additional JPY 2,750 per person (last order at 90 minutes). Ideal for business entertaining, formal dinners, anniversaries, and other special occasions.",
        "raw": "<p class=\"rstdtl-course-list__desc\">\n                          The &quot;Rare Cuts Tasting Course&quot; — 12 dishes including A5 Wagyu.\n                          Starting with an assorted kimchi, the course features seared Wagyu sushi, Premium salted tongue, salted strip loin, salted top blade, hanging tender, and today&#39;s finishing dish, allowing you to enjoy both popular items and rare cuts.\n                          You can also add a 120-minute all-you-can-drink option for an additional JPY 2,750 per person (last order at 90 minutes). Ideal for business entertaining, formal dinners, anniversaries, and other special occasions.\n                        </p>",
        "sha256": "e568cd5ad89240b1a728411b63796473c97dd16f405810c01f15b396bd81a0ec",
